  "description": "Enjoy the relaxed coastal lifestyle in this beautifully finished two-bedroom, one-bathroom home, offering modern styling, comfortable interiors and a lovely grassed outdoor area.<br/><br/>With its fresh coastal feel and contemporary finishes, this home is an appealing option for singles, couples or anyone seeking a low-maintenance property without compromising on comfort or style.<br/><br/>Both bedrooms are carpeted for added comfort and feature mirrored built-in robes, providing practical storage while maintaining the home's clean, modern aesthetic.<br/>The thoughtful layout makes excellent use of the available space, creating a comfortable home that is easy to maintain and enjoy. <br/><br/>Outside, the lovely grassed area offers room to unwind, enjoy a morning coffee or simply make the most of the fresh coastal air.<br/><br/>A single lock-up garage completes the property, providing secure parking and everyday convenience.<br/><br/>Please note this is a highly private, self-contained dual-key residence featuring a shared driveway, sub-metered utilities, and its own fully separate, private backyard.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>• Split System Reverse Cycle Air conditioning<br/>• Comfortable, easy-care living<br/>• Lovely grassed outdoor area<br/>• Single lock-up garage<br/>• Low-maintenance lifestyle<br/><br/>Whether you are a single professional, a couple or simply looking for a stylish home that is easy to care for, 21A Velvet Vista offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy modern coastal living in Alkimos.<br/><br/>Important Information regarding applying for this property:<br/><br/>Online Applications Only<br/><br/>Please feel free to apply online before viewing the property; however, we will only present applications to the landlord from tenants who have viewed in person or through a representative. For those attending on behalf of a prospective tenant, please be advised it is the representative's responsibility to note details seen on the day, including features throughout the property such as air conditioning.<br/><br/>Disclaimer: The above listing information has been provided by sources we deem reliable. We do not accept any responsibility to any person for its accuracy. All interested parties should rely on their own enquiries to determine the accuracy of this information.<br/><br/>",
